Prune Delivery Application

An enterprise-grade Android application for delivery operations, field workforce management, telecom activations, and electric vehicle rentals. The platform streamlines rider onboarding, order fulfillment, real-time tracking, KYC verification, and operational management through role-based workflows.

Overview

Prune is designed to support multiple user roles, including Delivery Partners, Field Agents, and Team Leads. It provides an integrated platform for managing the complete delivery lifecycle, from partner onboarding and order assignment to delivery completion, incentives, and reporting.

The application combines native Android technologies, real-time synchronization, mapping solutions, and third-party SDK integrations to support reliable field operations.

Features

1. Rider Onboarding & KYC

- Aadhaar KYC verification using the FRSLabs Atlas SDK.
- PAN card and address verification workflows.
- Document capture and photo uploads.
- Camera integration using CameraX.
- Image cropping and processing using uCrop.
- Guided onboarding workflows for delivery partners.

2. Order Management & Fulfillment

- Real-time incoming order notifications.
- Custom floating overlays for urgent delivery requests.
- Lock-screen order alerts and full-screen notification flows.
- Order acceptance and lifecycle status updates.
- Order rescheduling and return-to-origin (RTO) management.
- Delivery completion and status synchronization.

3. Real-Time Location Tracking & Navigation

- Rider location tracking using Android location services.
- Foreground services for continuous tracking.
- Google Maps and Ola Maps SDK integrations.
- Route directions, navigation, and map annotations.
- Uber H3 integration for spatial indexing.
- Background synchronization for field operations.

4. EV Rental Management

- Browse and compare available electric vehicles.
- Select rental vendors and pickup locations.
- Manage security deposits and rental payments.
- Confirm vehicle pickup.
- Track rental payment status and rental workflows.

5. Team Lead & Staff Management

- Role-based access for delivery partners and team leads.
- Monitor ongoing, pending, and reported orders.
- Oversee delivery partner operations.
- Access operational dashboards and reports.
- Separate workflows for rider operations and administrative functions.

6. Wallet, Incentives & Referrals

- Wallet transaction history.
- Wallet transfer reports.
- Live offers and promotional incentives.
- Shift-based incentive calculations.
- Rider referral programs.

