Key Engineering Highlights

Reliable Background Execution

Implemented foreground services and background processing workflows to support continuous rider location tracking and order synchronization, with appropriate Android permission and lifecycle handling.

Real-Time Order Notifications

Developed custom order alert flows using alarm receivers, floating overlays, and full-screen activities to bring high-priority delivery requests to the rider's attention, including relevant lock-screen scenarios.

Third-Party SDK Integration

Integrated multiple SDKs into the Android application, including:

- FRSLabs Atlas for KYC verification.
- Ola Maps for mapping and navigation.
- Google Maps for location visualization.
- Google ML Kit for barcode and QR code scanning.
- CameraX for camera operations.

Hybrid UI Development

Worked with Jetpack Compose and Material 3 alongside traditional XML-based screens, using ViewBinding and DataBinding to support a hybrid Android codebase.

Role-Based Workflows

Structured rider and Team Lead functionality around distinct operational requirements, supporting role-specific screens, order visibility, and administrative workflows.

Operational Monitoring

Integrated Firebase Crashlytics, Firebase Analytics, and Microsoft Clarity to support crash investigation, application analytics, and user interaction insights.

